# Setup Guide

## 1. Flash Armbian to SD card
- Use Balena Etcher
- Insert into TV box

## 2. First boot
- Access via SSH
- Configure network

## 3. Fix repositories (if needed)
- Edit sources.list

## 4. Install Pi-hole
curl -sSL https://install.pi-hole.net | bash

## 5. Configure DNS
- Set router DNS to Pi-hole IP
